# PHASE 1 of the escape investigation.  TEMPEST_POOL_FEAT=rad
# dataset=YouTube d_emb=64 k_train=5 lr=1e-3 seed=5 patience 8 cap 100
# branch=exp/escape-instrumentation commit=7e97fda6 (DETACHED WORKTREE, pinned)
#
# QUESTION. The control escapes at ep14 (val 0.4299 -> 0.4945 -> 0.6000); the
#   sdist arm never does (0.4088 -> 0.4137 -> 0.4193) and finishes 0.4002 against
#   0.5626. Every conclusion so far was inferred from the final val number. These
#   two runs instrument the transition itself.
#
# THE ARMS DIFFER IN ONE LINE. Third pooler channel only:
#     rad   = dist0(token)        <- master, escapes
#     sdist = dist(seed, token)   <- does not
#   Both detached, both n_feat=3, so Linear(3,32) either way and the pooler init
#   hash is IDENTICAL (bcf56421f97deb3a, verified). No init-luck confound.
#
# NEW FIELDS. pool_eff = exp(entropy) = effective tokens the bag actually uses
#   (8.93 of ~22 at init); pool_ent normalised entropy, 1.0 = uniform; pool_max
#   mean largest weight; logit_sd pre-softmax spread; r50/r90/r99 radius
#   percentiles; dE mean per-row movement of E since the last epoch.
#
# WHAT THE EXISTING LOGS ALREADY SHOW, and what these must explain. At ep14-17 the
#   control's link COLLAPSES -- 0.3357 -> 0.2482 -> 0.1869 -> 0.1536, i.e. -26%,
#   -25%, -18% per epoch -- and geo_temp ACCELERATES (+1.8, +2.0, +2.0). The sdist
#   arm at the same epochs falls a steady -4%/epoch and geo_temp DECELERATES
#   (+0.6, +0.5, +0.5). Both sit at nearly the same r_mean (0.465 vs 0.456), so
#   radius alone does not separate them. Something goes critical in the control
#   and not in sdist; these fields should say what.
#
# patience raised to 8 (from 5) so the sdist arm is given every chance to escape
#   late rather than being cut off; that also costs little.
# started=2026-09-17 00:09:07
# cmd: TEMPEST_POOL_FEAT=rad /its/home/ms2420/tempest-embeddinng/venv/bin/python -u scripts/train_link_property_prediction.py --data-suite tgb-seq --dataset YouTube --d-emb 64 --k-train 5 --num-walks-per-node 5 --lr 1e-3 --seed 5 --early-stop-patience 8 --use-gpu --use-gpu-tempest

